    "dt": 1.2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ex_36",
   "t": 282.98,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 8.24,
   "ref": "Exodus 14:13-14",
   "zh": "小朋友，遇到害怕的事，你也可以向上帝祷告。他会听见，也会给你带路哦！",
   "en": "When you're scared, you can pray to God too. He hears you, and he'll show you the way!",
   "dir": "warm moral, speaking right to the child; smile on the last sentence",
   "dur": 8.19,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 2.2,
